"megnyitásához kattintson a képernyő jobb felső sarkában lévő felhasználói "
"avatarra."

#: ../../content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:98
msgid ""
"On the dashboard, open the :guilabel:`Apps` tab, and create an app. Follow "
"the four steps in the app creation flow (app name, needed apps, app status, "
